{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://schemas.replicant.example.com/qa/role-result-qa/v1.json",
  "title": "QA role_result (replicant.role-result.qa/v1)",
  "description": "WS-05 (owner per run-result.schema.json). Embedded as run_result.role_result for role 'qa'. A compact, bounded summary that the workflow reads through runner.get_run → result_uri without fetching the full qa_report. Must stay well under the 1 MiB run_result limit: the harness caps top_failures at 20 entries and every string field at its maxLength. Mapping to the envelope's run_result.outcome (R1-116): verdict pass|pass_with_warnings → 'completed'; fail → 'failed'; inconclusive → 'failed' (QA never uses 'blocked', which C-RUNNER reserves for 'needs a human'); not_applicable → 'no_changes'. Consumers (WS-01 qa_run node, WS-07 packet) must read role_result.verdict, never outcome alone. run_result.outputs.qa_report holds the full report key. AgentRun mapping (C-RUNNER/C-CRD 2.1.0): verdict inconclusive caused by an environment check in a setup stage makes the entrypoint exit 44 (prepare/install/build tooling) or 45 (services/stubs/seed), i.e. failure reason EnvironmentSetupFailed, with this role_result still written; all other verdicts exit 0.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "verdict",
    "reason_code",
    "counts",
    "by_cause",
    "stages",
    "subject",
    "base_pass_performed",
    "test_inventory_delta"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "replicant.role-result.qa/v1"
    },
    "verdict": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "pass",
        "pass_with_warnings",
        "fail",
        "inconclusive",
        "not_applicable"
      ]
    },
    "reason_code": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "all_passed",
        "non_blocking_findings",
        "regression",
        "new_flake",
        "build_broken",
        "app_unhealthy",
        "a11y_regression",
        "visual_unexpected",
        "environment_failure",
        "budget_exhausted",
        "unsupported_runtime",
        "qa_disabled",
        "unknown_failure",
        "contract_breaking",
        "secret_in_image"
      ]
    },
    "counts": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "total",
        "passed",
        "failed",
        "flaky",
        "skipped",
        "blocking"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "passed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "failed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "flaky": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "skipped": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "blocking": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "by_cause": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "code": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "flaky_new": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "flaky_known": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "pre_existing": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "environment": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "test_defect": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "unknown": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "stages": {
      "description": "One entry per stage that was configured.",
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 40,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "stage",
          "status"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "stage": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "prepare",
              "install",
              "unit",
              "integration",
              "build",
              "lint",
              "image_build",
              "sbom",
              "secret_scan",
              "services",
              "stubs",
              "seed",
              "app_start",
              "health",
              "smoke",
              "routes",
              "e2e_repo",
              "e2e_generated",
              "contract_compat",
              "a11y",
              "visual",
              "shutdown",
              "agent"
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "passed",
              "failed",
              "warning",
              "skipped",
              "not_run",
              "error"
            ]
          },
          "duration_seconds": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "cause": {
            "description": "Why a failed stage failed (onboarding-interfaces.md section 3 probe_failure causes).",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "missing_tool",
              "network",
              "timeout",
              "test_failure",
              "build_failure",
              "install_failure",
              "lint_failure"
            ]
          },
          "detail": {
            "description": "E.g. the missing binary's name or the unreachable host.",
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 256
          },
          "command": {
            "description": "The repo command the stage ran (environment.commands), when not a built-in stage.",
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "top_failures": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 20,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "stage",
          "test_id",
          "status",
          "cause",
          "blocking"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "stage": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 32
          },
          "test_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 512
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "failed",
              "flaky",
              "error"
            ]
          },
          "cause": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "code",
              "flaky_new",
              "flaky_known",
              "pre_existing",
              "environment",
              "test_defect",
              "unknown"
            ]
          },
          "rule": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Z][0-9]{1,2}[a-z]?$"
          },
          "blocking": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "message": {
            "description": "Redacted, ≤ 500 characters. Untrusted text.",
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 500
          },
          "file": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 1024
          },
          "line": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "env_signature": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 64
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "subject": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "base_sha",
        "diff_bundle_sha256"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "base_sha": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{40}([0-9a-f]{24})?$"
        },
        "head_tree_sha": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{40}([0-9a-f]{24})?$"
        },
        "diff_bundle_sha256": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        }
      }
    },
    "image_digest": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^sha256:[0-9a-f]{64}$"
    },
    "base_pass_performed": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "web": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "screenshots": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "a11y_new_serious": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "visual_pages_changed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    },
    "agent_cost_usd_reported": {
      "type": "number",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "budget_exhausted": {
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "agentrun_exit_class": {
      "description": "Harness exit class (WS-03 cli-invocation.md section 4.10; orchestrator ruling on R1V-023): pass, pass_with_warnings, fail, inconclusive_other, not_applicable → entrypoint exit 0; environment_setup (prepare, install, build tooling) → 44; environment_services (services, stubs, seed) → 45 (EnvironmentSetupFailed, run_result still written, verdict inconclusive).",
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "pass",
        "pass_with_warnings",
        "fail",
        "inconclusive_other",
        "not_applicable",
        "environment_setup",
        "environment_services"
      ]
    },
    "test_inventory_delta": {
      "description": "R2-006 summary of qa_report.test_inventory.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "method",
        "tests_removed",
        "tests_skipped_added",
        "deleted_or_skipped"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "method": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "listed",
            "junit",
            "static"
          ]
        },
        "tests_removed": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "tests_skipped_added": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "deleted_test_files": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "skip_markers_added": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "deleted_or_skipped": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      }
    },
    "contract_compat": {
      "description": "K1 result exported to the graph (XD-FIX-R1-120): runner.read_result copies it to role_exports.contract_compat, and WS-01's contract_check node (check_step contract_compat, source qa_report) applies the per-workflow-type policy. K1 itself never blocks: the qa_run node passes run input contract_compat: report_only, which forces blockOnBreaking false. Absent when no compat checks were staged.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "outcome",
        "breaking",
        "consumers",
        "report_uri"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "outcome": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "compatible",
            "breaking",
            "not_applicable"
          ]
        },
        "breaking": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "consumers": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "report_uri": {
          "type": "string",
          "maxLength": 1100,
          "pattern": "^s3://[a-z0-9][a-z0-9.-]{1,61}[a-z0-9]/.+"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "harness_result": {
      "title": "/replicant/out/qa/result.json (WS-03 cli-invocation.md section 4.10, XD-FIX-R1-073)",
      "description": "Written by replicant-qa last; read by replicant-entrypoint, which writes run_result with role_result and exits per exit_class (WS-03 cli-invocation.md section 4.10). run_result.outcome follows the verdict, never blocked (XD-W2-05-01 ruling): pass, pass_with_warnings → completed; not_applicable → no_changes; fail, inconclusive → failed.",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "verdict",
        "exit_class",
        "role_result"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "verdict": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "pass",
            "pass_with_warnings",
            "fail",
            "inconclusive",
            "not_applicable"
          ]
        },
        "exit_class": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "pass",
            "pass_with_warnings",
            "fail",
            "inconclusive_other",
            "not_applicable",
            "environment_setup",
            "environment_services"
          ],
          "description": "Harness exit class (WS-03 cli-invocation.md section 4.10; orchestrator ruling on R1V-023): pass, pass_with_warnings, fail, inconclusive_other, not_applicable → entrypoint exit 0; environment_setup (prepare, install, build tooling) → 44; environment_services (services, stubs, seed) → 45 (EnvironmentSetupFailed, run_result still written, verdict inconclusive)."
        },
        "role_result": {
          "$ref": "#"
        }
      },
      "allOf": [
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "exit_class": {
                "enum": [
                  "inconclusive_other",
                  "environment_setup",
                  "environment_services"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "verdict": {
                "const": "inconclusive"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "if": {
            "properties": {
              "exit_class": {
                "enum": [
                  "pass",
                  "pass_with_warnings",
                  "fail",
                  "not_applicable"
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "then": {
            "properties": {
              "verdict": {
                "not": {
                  "const": "inconclusive"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}